Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 17:33:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: skip link previews for pasted links

Add a link preview mode that suppresses automatic previews for pasted links only.

Constraint: Explicit preview selection and no_link_previews behavior stay unchanged

Rejected: Add Only ones you add mode now | Android paste provenance needs device verification first

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: Manual paste, rich paste and Gboard verification on device
